<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Polaris 9650iQ Sport Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="This smart cleaner connects to Wi-Fi and can be controlled via an app. Excellent for tech-savvy users."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport"/><meta property="og:title" content="Polaris 9650iQ Sport Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="This smart cleaner connects to Wi-Fi and can be controlled via an app. Excellent for tech-savvy users."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Polaris 9650iQ Sport<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6" alt="Polaris 9650iQ Sport" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Polaris 9650iQ Sport is a 4-wheel drive robotic cleaner that brings the legendary Polaris power into the smart home era. It connects directly to your home&#x27;s Wi-Fi network, allowing you to control it from anywhere in the world via the iAquaLink app. Beyond its brains, it features a rugged 4WD system that can tackle stairs and obstacles that leave other robots spinning their wheels.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>This robot is the top choice for:</p><ul><li><strong>Tech-savvy homeowners</strong> who want full control from their phone.</li><li>Pools with <strong>stairs, benches, and obstacles</strong> that require 4-wheel drive.</li><li>Users who hate lifting heavy robots (thanks to the Lift System).</li><li>Those who want a cleaner that comes with a <strong>premium caddy included</strong>.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Look elsewhere if:</p><ul><li><strong>You have weak Wi-Fi by the pool:</strong> The smart features rely on a strong signal. Without it, you're paying for features you can't use.</li><li><strong>You prefer a simple cleaner:</strong> If you don't want to set up an account and connect to Wi-Fi, a Dolphin Nautilus is simpler.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Wi-Fi Connectivity:</strong> Full control via the iAquaLink app from anywhere.</li><li><strong>4-Wheel Drive:</strong> Superior traction for climbing stairs and navigating obstacles.</li><li><strong>Easy Lift System:</strong> Automatically surfaces and drains water for effortless removal.</li><li><strong>Dirty Canister Indicator:</strong> Alerts you when it's time to empty the debris.</li><li><strong>Premium Caddy Included:</strong> Comes with a high-quality transport caddy, a rare inclusion at this price point.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>iAquaLink Control:</strong> The 9650iQ's standout feature is its connectivity. Unlike Bluetooth models, this robot connects to Wi-Fi. This means you can start a cleaning cycle from your office, check the filter status while on vacation, or update the firmware over the air. The app is intuitive and allows for custom cleaning schedules and modes.</p><p><strong>4-Wheel Drive Agility:</strong> While most robots use tracks, the Polaris uses four large, rugged wheels with dedicated drive motors. This allows it to climb over main drains, scale stairs effortlessly, and navigate rough pool surfaces like pebble tec without getting stuck. The front brushes scrub the surface while the powerful vortex vacuum sucks up debris.</p><p><strong>Easy Lift System:</strong> One of the most practical features is the 'Easy Lift' button. When you press it in the app or on the control box, the robot climbs the wall to the waterline and waits for you. As you pull it out, it automatically evacuates all the water, making it incredibly light to lift onto the deck. No more hauling a heavy, water-filled machine.</p><p><strong>Dirty Canister Indicator:</strong> The robot takes the guesswork out of maintenance. A sensor detects when the filter canister is full and alerts you via the app, ensuring you never run a cycle with a clogged filter.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">True Wi-Fi connectivity for remote control</li><li class="list-group-item">4WD system handles stairs better than tracked robots</li><li class="list-group-item">Lift system makes removal effortless</li><li class="list-group-item">Includes a premium caddy (saves ~$150)</li><li class="list-group-item">Large 5-liter debris canister</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Requires strong Wi-Fi signal at the pool pad</li><li class="list-group-item">Can struggle with very fine dust compared to Dolphin&#x27;s micro-filters</li><li class="list-group-item">Cord can still tangle despite the swivel</li><li class="list-group-item">Wheels can sometimes leave marks on very soft vinyl liners</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Polaris 9650iQ Sport is the smartest robot on this list. If you love smart home tech, this is the cleaner for you. The convenience of the Easy Lift system and the included caddy make it a joy to use daily. While its fine-dust filtration isn&#x27;t quite as elite as the Dolphin Premier, its ability to navigate complex pools and be controlled from anywhere makes it a top-tier contender.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Sigma">Dolphin Sigma</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1899</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-F9550-Sport">Polaris F9550 Sport</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1099</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"413\",\"static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js\",\"183\",\"static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"sta"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tic/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nb:T53f,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiAquaLink Control:\u003c/strong\u003e The 9650iQ's standout feature is its connectivity. Unlike Bluetooth models, this robot connects to Wi-Fi. This means you can start a cleaning cycle from your office, check the filter status while on vacation, or update the firmware over