rugged 4WD system that can tackle stairs and obstacles that leave other robots spinning their wheels.\"}],[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Who This Is For\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eThis robot is the top choice for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTech-savvy homeowners\u003c/strong\u003e who want full control from their phone.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePools with \u003cstrong\u003estairs, benches, and obstacles\u003c/strong\u003e that require 4-wheel drive.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUsers who hate lifting heavy robots (thanks to the Lift System).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThose who want a cleaner that comes with a \u003cstrong\u003epremium caddy included\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Who Should Skip It\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eLook elsewhere if:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou have weak Wi-Fi by the pool:\u003c/strong\u003e The smart features rely on a strong signal. Without it, you're paying for features you can't use.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou prefer a simple cleaner:\u003c/strong\u003e If you don't want to set up an account and connect to Wi-Fi, a Dolphin Nautilus is simpler.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Key Features\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWi-Fi Connectivity:\u003c/strong\u003e Full control via the iAquaLink app from anywhere.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4-Wheel Drive:\u003c/strong\u003e Superior traction for climbing stairs and navigating obstacles.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Lift System:\u003c/strong\u003e Automatically surfaces and drains water for effortless removal.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDirty Canister Indicator:\u003c/strong\u003e Alerts you when it's time to empty the debris.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Caddy Included:\u003c/strong\u003e Comes with a high-quality transport caddy, a rare inclusion at this price point.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$b\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"True Wi-Fi connectivity for remote control\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"4WD system handles stairs better than tracked robots\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Lift system makes removal effortless\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Includes a premium caddy (saves ~$150)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Large 5-liter debris canister\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Requires strong Wi-Fi signal at the pool pad\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Can struggle with very fine dust compared to Dolphin's micro-filters\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Cord can still tangle despite the swivel\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Wheels can sometimes leave marks on very soft vinyl liners\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Polaris 9650iQ Sport is the smartest robot on this list. If you love smart home tech, this is the cleaner for you. The convenience of the Easy Lift system and the included caddy make it a joy to use daily. While its fine-dust filtration isn't quite as elite as the Dolphin Premier, its ability to navigate complex pools and be controlled from anywhere makes it a top-tier contender.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Polaris 9650iQ Sport\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dolphin-Sigma\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/